# The repository root ignores *.png. That is wrong for this directory: the
# figures in img/ are the poster's own content, embedded in pages served to a
# conference audience, not incidental output. Re-include them here.
!img/*.png

# A browser "save page as" dump of the iPoster editor, kept locally as a
# reference for the template's block geometry. Third-party assets, not ours to
# republish, and this whole directory is mirrored to the public site by the sync
# workflow, so it must never be tracked.
iPoster*/
iPoster_preview_live/
